Package: rauhwt
Type: Project
Title: Billionaire Tax Act NPV Replication (Rauh, Jaros, Kearney, Doran & Cosso 2026)
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Fernando", "Hoces", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproduces the revenue and net-present-value estimates of Rauh,
    Jaros, Kearney, Doran & Cosso (2026), "The Net Present Value of the
    Billionaire Tax Act" (SSRN 6340778, Hoover Institution), and the September
    2026 NBER litigation-risk-weighted version by Jaros & Rauh, from the
    authors' public MIT-licensed materials (github.com/bjaros20/wealth_tax).
